# The ledger of `grpc`: gRPC over HTTP/2, against Go 1.27's grpc-go 1.85.0
# (grpc, codes, status, metadata, health, health/grpc_health_v1, reflection,
# encoding/gzip, credentials), Rust's tonic 0.14 with tonic-health and
# tonic-reflection (docs built 2026-11-18), and Python 3.15's grpcio 1.85.3
# with grpcio-health-checking and grpcio-reflection, listed from this machine
# on 2026-11-18.

capability status/codes  the status codes and their names
  heroes  grpc.STATUS_OK, grpc.STATUS_CANCELLED, grpc.STATUS_UNKNOWN, grpc.STATUS_INVALID_ARGUMENT, grpc.STATUS_DEADLINE_EXCEEDED, grpc.STATUS_NOT_FOUND, grpc.STATUS_ALREADY_EXISTS, grpc.STATUS_PERMISSION_DENIED, grpc.STATUS_RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED, grpc.STATUS_FAILED_PRECONDITION, grpc.STATUS_ABORTED, grpc.STATUS_OUT_OF_RANGE, grpc.STATUS_UNIMPLEMENTED, grpc.STATUS_INTERNAL, grpc.STATUS_UNAVAILABLE, grpc.STATUS_DATA_LOSS, grpc.STATUS_UNAUTHENTICATED, grpc.status_name
  go      grpc.Code, grpc/codes.Aborted, grpc/codes.AlreadyExists, grpc/codes.Canceled, grpc/codes.Code, grpc/codes.Code.String, grpc/codes.Code.UnmarshalJSON, grpc/codes.DataLoss, grpc/codes.DeadlineExceeded, grpc/codes.FailedPrecondition, grpc/codes.Internal, grpc/codes.InvalidArgument, grpc/codes.NotFound, grpc/codes.OK, grpc/codes.OutOfRange, grpc/codes.PermissionDenied, grpc/codes.ResourceExhausted, grpc/codes.Unauthenticated, grpc/codes.Unavailable, grpc/codes.Unimplemented, grpc/codes.Unknown
