  python  grpc.StatusCode, grpc.StatusCode.ABORTED, grpc.StatusCode.ALREADY_EXISTS, grpc.StatusCode.CANCELLED, grpc.StatusCode.DATA_LOSS, grpc.StatusCode.DEADLINE_EXCEEDED, grpc.StatusCode.FAILED_PRECONDITION, grpc.StatusCode.INTERNAL, grpc.StatusCode.INVALID_ARGUMENT, grpc.StatusCode.NOT_FOUND, grpc.StatusCode.OK, grpc.StatusCode.OUT_OF_RANGE, grpc.StatusCode.PERMISSION_DENIED, grpc.StatusCode.RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED, grpc.StatusCode.UNAUTHENTICATED, grpc.StatusCode.UNAVAILABLE, grpc.StatusCode.UNIMPLEMENTED, grpc.StatusCode.UNKNOWN
  note    a code past 16 from a peer is kept as it came, as Go keeps it

