capability server/dispatch  the next call found by its path, an unknown one answered UNIMPLEMENTED
  heroes  grpc.next_call, grpc.ServerCall
  go      grpc.Server.RegisterService, grpc.StreamHandler, grpc.UnaryHandler, grpc.UnknownServiceHandler
  rust    tonic::server::ClientStreamingService, tonic::server::ClientStreamingService::call, tonic::server::Grpc::borrow, tonic::server::Grpc::borrow_mut, tonic::server::Grpc::fmt, tonic::server::Grpc::from, tonic::server::Grpc::in_current_span, tonic::server::Grpc::instrument, tonic::server::Grpc::into, tonic::server::Grpc::into_request, tonic::server::Grpc::named_layer, tonic::server::Grpc::try_from, tonic::server::Grpc::try_into, tonic::server::Grpc::type_id, tonic::server::Grpc::with_current_subscriber, tonic::server::Grpc::with_subscriber, tonic::server::ServerStreamingService, tonic::server::ServerStreamingService::call, tonic::server::StreamingService, tonic::server::StreamingService::call, tonic::server::UnaryService, tonic::server::UnaryService::call, tonic::server::grpc::Grpc, tonic::server::service::ClientStreamingService, tonic::server::service::ServerStreamingService, tonic::server::service::StreamingService, tonic::server::service::UnaryService
  python  -
  note    the server finds the method; the program calls its own handler with its own state, there being no closure (README § B3); a request not POST is answered 405, another content-type 415

